OL,3,GNEWSAExplosion 'incident waiting to
OL,4,Ahappen', court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork on gas pipes the day before a
OL,7,Ffatal explosion in Jersey was done "not
OL,8,Fjust carelessly but exceptionally
OL,9,Fbadly", a court has heard.
OL,11,FGas workers Lee Ward, 59, Neil
OL,12,FArmstrong, 58, and John Wright, 60,
OL,13,Fhave each pleaded not guilty to 10
OL,14,Fcounts of gross negligence manslaughter
OL,15,Fover the deaths of 10 residents at the
OL,16,FHaut du Mont flats in St Helier
OL,17,Ffollowing the blast on 10 December
OL,18,F2022.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
