OL,3,GNEWSAExplosion 'incident waiting to
OL,4,Ahappen', court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe manslaughter case is being combined
OL,7,Fwith a health and safety case against
OL,8,Fgas company Island Energy (IE) at
OL,9,FJersey's Royal Court.
OL,11,FChief executive Graeme Millar, on
OL,12,Fbehalf of the company, has pleaded not
OL,13,Fguilty to two counts of failing to keep
OL,14,Fpeople safe during the events around
OL,15,Fthe explosion.
